['language','series','type','color','level','cost','trait','rarity','power','trigger','sort'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).onchange=()=>{if(id==='language')seriesOptions();filter();});let timer;$('#search').oninput=()=>{clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(filter,180);};$('#prev').onclick=()=>{page--;renderGrid();};$('#next').onclick=()=>{page++;renderGrid();};$('#clear-filters').onclick=()=>{['series','type','color','level','cost','trait','rarity','power','trigger','search'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).value='');filter();};document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='/'&&!/INPUT|TEXTAREA|SELECT/.test(e.target.tagName)) {e.preventDefault();view('library');$('#search').focus();}if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key==='z'&&activeView==='practice'&&!/INPUT|TEXTAREA/.test(e.target.tagName)){e.preventDefault();undo();}});
function add(id){draft.cards[id]=(draft.cards[id]||0)+1;saveDraft();renderDock();if(activeView==='decks')renderDeck();toast('Added '+catalog.get(id).name);}
